<title>GREECE: FORMER POLITICAL SPRING MP ANDREAS LENTAKIS DIES- RADIO.</title>
<headline>FORMER POLITICAL SPRING MP ANDREAS LENTAKIS DIES- RADIO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Political Spring member of parliament Andreas Lentakis died of a heart attack on Thursday at Hipocration hospital, radios said.</p>
<p>Lentakis, a writer and former mayor of Hymettos was born in 1934 in Addis Ababa. He is survived by his wife and two sons. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
